{"seq":2,"slug":"refund-deadline-original-payment","title":"退款时限与原支付路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/statutory-withdrawal-coolingoff-compliance/withdrawal-execution/refund-deadline-original-payment","wordCount":2172,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"退款时限与原支付路径\">退款时限与原支付路径</h1><p>撤回受理完成之后，摆在资金链上的问题是两个：<strong>多久必须退</strong>、<strong>必须退到哪</strong>。这两个问题在欧盟法里都有硬性答案——14 天内，且原则上必须用消费者当初使用的同一支付方式——而跨境场景让这两条简单规则的实现变得相当不简单：原支付渠道可能已经关闭、退款手续费需要被禁止转嫁、多张卡分摊的订单需要按比例回退。而一旦卖家在售前没有给出撤回权告知，起算锚点会从「收到撤回通知」变成「收到退货」甚至「消费者举证已寄出」，退款时钟的起点整个改变。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>退款有两个硬约束和一组现实阻碍。两个硬约束是：<strong>14 天内</strong>退完全部款项（含标准配送费），且<strong>用原支付方式</strong>退回、不得向消费者收取任何费用。一组现实阻碍是：原卡失效、渠道下线、多卡分摊、以及网关手续费——它们不会让约束失效，只会让达到约束的路径变长，而每条替代路径都需要显式证据。</p>\n<p>因此本节的核心设计是<strong>把退款建模为一次可复现的推导</strong>：从起算锚点算出到期时刻，从金额构成算出应付净额，从支付来源结构算出回退腿，三者各自留痕。一笔退款如果只有一个净额数字而没有这三段推导，就无法应对争议，也无法应对审计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"14-天退款的两种起算锚点\">14 天退款的两种起算锚点</h2><p><a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/eudr/2011/83/article/13\">第 13(1) 条</a>要求卖家退还从消费者处收到的<strong>全部款项，包括配送费</strong>，「without undue delay and in any event not later than 14 days from the day on which he is informed」——从得知撤回决定之日起 14 天。英国 <a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2013/3134/regulation/34\">CCR 第 34 条</a>给出了更细的分支，其中最关键的是：对未提供取件服务的买卖，14 天从<strong>卖家收到退货</strong>或<strong>消费者提供寄出证明</strong>两者中较早者起算。</p>\n<p>这构成了两个并存的锚点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>锚点</th>\n<th>适用条件</th>\n<th>起算事件</th>\n<th>对卖家的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>通知锚点</td>\n<td>默认；卖家已提供取件</td>\n<td>收到撤回通知</td>\n<td>时钟最早开始</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收货/寄出锚点</td>\n<td>未提供取件的买卖</td>\n<td>收到退货或寄出证明</td>\n<td>时钟可延后，但不得借此无限拖延</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; Notified: 收到撤回通知&#10;  Notified --&gt; AwaitingGoods: 卖家未提供取件&#10;  Notified --&gt; RefundClock: 卖家提供取件&#10;  AwaitingGoods --&gt; RefundClock: 收到退货或寄出证明&#10;  RefundClock --&gt; Refunded: 14 天内退款&#10;  RefundClock --&gt; Overdue: 超过 14 天&#10;  Overdue --&gt; Refunded: 补退 + 承担利息/罚则风险\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; Notified: 收到撤回通知\n  Notified --&gt; AwaitingGoods: 卖家未提供取件\n  Notified --&gt; RefundClock: 卖家提供取件\n  AwaitingGoods --&gt; RefundClock: 收到退货或寄出证明\n  RefundClock --&gt; Refunded: 14 天内退款\n  RefundClock --&gt; Overdue: 超过 14 天\n  Overdue --&gt; Refunded: 补退 + 承担利息/罚则风险</pre><h3 id=\"暂缓退款-的合法边界\">「暂缓退款」的合法边界</h3><p><a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/eudr/2011/83/article/13\">第 13(3) 条</a>的实务表述是：卖家可以在收到退货或消费者提供寄出证明之前暂缓退款。这条常被误读为「可以等到收货再退」，从而把 14 天时钟推迟数周。正确的读法是：<strong>暂缓的合法性依赖卖家是否提供了取件义务的免除</strong>——若卖家承担取件，则该暂缓权不成立，时钟从通知起算。</p>\n<p>工程上这意味着「暂缓」不是一个可以随手设置的开关，而是政策版本里的一个派生布尔值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"may_withhold_refund(order_line, policy, snapshot):&#10;  if policy.collect_by_trader: return FALSE          # 已提供取件，不得暂缓&#10;  if receipt_confirmed(order_line): return FALSE     # 已收货&#10;  if dispatch_evidence_uploaded(order_line): return FALSE&#10;  return snapshot.resolved_rules.withhold_allowed == true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>may_withhold_refund(order_line, policy, snapshot):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if policy.collect_by_trader: return FALSE          # 已提供取件，不得暂缓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if receipt_confirmed(order_line): return FALSE     # 已收货</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if dispatch_evidence_uploaded(order_line): return FALSE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return snapshot.resolved_rules.withhold_allowed == true</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"退款金额的构成\">退款金额的构成</h2><p>退款不是「商品售价」，而是一个有明确构成的清单，且每一项的退款义务来源不同：</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么必须逐项而非净额\">为什么必须逐项而非净额</h3><p>净额对消费者是不可解释的：他看到的「少了 12 欧元」会变成工单。逐项拆分后，每一行都能对应到一条规则或一份证据，客服用一句话就能解释扣减来源。这也是本节所有表结构的共同目的——<strong>让退款金额成为一个可复现的推导结果，而不是一个存下来的数字</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"标准配送费的上限逻辑\">标准配送费的上限逻辑</h3><p>标准配送费必须全退，但消费者自选的加急配送差价不退。这条看似琐碎的区分在跨境场景里很重要：跨境配送常有多种时效与价格档，若不区分档位，一次加急订单的退款会把加急差价一并退出，形成系统性成本泄漏。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>构成项</th>\n<th>是否必退</th>\n<th>依据与例外</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>商品价款</td>\n<td>必退</td>\n<td>第 13(1) 条</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标准配送费</td>\n<td>必退</td>\n<td>第 13(1) 条「including … the costs of delivery」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消费者自选的加急配送差价</td>\n<td>不退</td>\n<td>仅退卖家最便宜的标准配送方式对应金额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退回运费</td>\n<td>视归属</td>\n<td>见 <a href=\"return-cost-buyer-assume-rule\">退回运费归属与买家承担规则</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增值服务费（礼品包装等）</td>\n<td>视约定</td>\n<td>未提供则不构成合同标的</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关税与进口税</td>\n<td>按法域</td>\n<td>多数法域需退还，且常需另行报关冲销</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/eudr/2011/83/annex/I\">Annex I(A)</a> 给消费者的表述证实了「最便宜标准配送」这条上限：「Supplementary delivery costs are excluded where the consumer chose a method other than the least expensive type of standard delivery offered by us.」</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE withdrawal_refund_quote (&#10;  request_id       BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  order_id         BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  currency         CHAR(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  goods_amount     NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  standard_ship_fee NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  expedited_delta  NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  return_cost_deducted NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  diminution_deducted  NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  tax_refund_amount    NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  net_payable      NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  computed_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  policy_version_id BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  breakdown        JSONB NOT NULL&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> withdrawal_refund_quote</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  request_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  goods_amount     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  standard_ship_fee </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  expedited_delta  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  return_cost_deducted </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  diminution_deducted  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tax_refund_amount    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  net_payable      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  computed_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  policy_version_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  breakdown        JSONB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>breakdown</code> 保留逐项推导过程。争议中能救回判定的从来不是 <code>net_payable</code> 这一个数字，而是它怎么来的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"原支付路径-同路退回与它的例外\">原支付路径：同路退回与它的例外</h2><p><a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/eudr/2011/83/article/13\">第 13(1) 条</a>要求使用「the same means of payment as the consumer used for the initial transaction」，除非消费者明确同意其他方式；同时要求消费者<strong>不因退款而承担任何费用</strong>。日本特定商取引法禁止商家在撤回后拒绝或延迟退款，中国与德国的规则取向一致。</p>\n<p>「同路退回」在跨境支付栈里会遇到四类现实阻碍，每一类都需要显式的降级路径与证据留存：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阻碍</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>处理</th>\n<th>需留存证据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>卡已失效/换卡</td>\n<td>原卡关闭</td>\n<td>走卡组织的退款映射或转账户余额（需消费者同意）</td>\n<td>消费者同意的耐久介质记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渠道已下线</td>\n<td>本地钱包停服</td>\n<td>转等价渠道并告知</td>\n<td>渠道下线公告 + 告知记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分期/多卡分摊</td>\n<td>一笔订单多资金来源</td>\n<td>按各来源比例回退</td>\n<td>支付分摊明细</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支付手续费</td>\n<td>网关向商户收费</td>\n<td><strong>不得转嫁</strong>给消费者</td>\n<td>费用账户的独立科目</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"禁止转嫁退款手续费\">禁止转嫁退款手续费</h3><p>「不得因退款向消费者收取费用」这一条是硬约束，它禁止的是把网关退款手续费、汇率损失、跨境汇款费从退款金额里扣掉。系统上需要的是<strong>费用与退款金额的账户分离</strong>：退款科目只记应付消费者的金额，手续费走商户成本科目。把两者混在一个净额里，是这类违规最常见的实现路径。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"issue_refund(quote, method):&#10;  if method != quote.original_method and not consumer_consented(method):&#10;    raise RequiresConsumerConsent&#10;  legs = allocate_by_original_sources(quote.net_payable, quote.breakdown.sources)&#10;  for leg in legs:&#10;    r = gateway.refund(leg.source_ref, leg.amount, idempotency_key=...)&#10;    record_refund_leg(leg, r, fee_bearer=&#39;MERCHANT&#39;)     # 费用固定由商户承担&#10;  assert sum(legs.amount) == quote.net_payable\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>issue_refund(quote, method):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if method != quote.original_method and not consumer_consented(method):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    raise RequiresConsumerConsent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  legs = allocate_by_original_sources(quote.net_payable, quote.breakdown.sources)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for leg in legs:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    r = gateway.refund(leg.source_ref, leg.amount, idempotency_key=...)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    record_refund_leg(leg, r, fee_bearer='MERCHANT')     # 费用固定由商户承担</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  assert sum(legs.amount) == quote.net_payable</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>idempotency_key</code> 不是可选项：退款是典型的「超时不代表没发生」的副作用，重试必须有幂等键，否则一次网络抖动会变成一笔双退。这些通道行为与拒付、支付失败恢复同源，展开见 [057 国际保修与售后] 之外的支付侧实现——本仓库对应 <a href=\"../../payment-failure-recovery-experience/\">086 支付失败恢复体验</a> 与 <a href=\"../../payment-chargeback-dispute-representment/\">161 拒付争议应对</a> 两个 hub。</p>\n<h2 id=\"关税-税费与跨境资金\">关税、税费与跨境资金</h2><p>跨境撤回退款里最容易出错的是税费。进口关税与增值税在清关环节由消费者或平台承担，撤回后需要走<strong>退运报关</strong>或<strong>税务冲销</strong>，这一步的资金回流通常滞后于商品退款数周。工程上的处理原则是<strong>分账而非合并</strong>：商品与运费在 14 天内退，税费按各自的回流周期单独记账并向消费者给出明确的预计时点。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>费用类型</th>\n<th>退款主体</th>\n<th>典型回流周期</th>\n<th>是否需要消费者配合</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>商品价款</td>\n<td>平台</td>\n<td>14 天内</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标准配送费</td>\n<td>平台</td>\n<td>14 天内</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进口增值税</td>\n<td>平台或报关行</td>\n<td>数周</td>\n<td>常需退运报关凭证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进口关税</td>\n<td>海关</td>\n<td>数周至数月</td>\n<td>是（退运证明）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支付通道费</td>\n<td>不向消费者退</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>商户承担</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把税费的预计时点在退款确认里显式告知，比把它藏进「部分退款」更能减少工单——消费者对「钱为什么少了」的困惑，多数来自合并金额而非等待时间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>14 天退款的起算锚点有两个：默认是收到撤回通知，未提供取件的买卖则以收到退货或寄出证明为锚。</li>\n<li>「暂缓退款」的合法性取决于卖家是否提供取件，是派生值而非可自由设置的开关。</li>\n<li>退款金额由商品价款、标准配送费、税费等多项构成，须逐项留痕并可复现。</li>\n<li>必须用原支付方式退回，禁止向消费者转嫁退款手续费；降级路径需消费者明示同意。</li>\n<li>关税与税费分账处理，按各自回流周期告知消费者预计到账时间。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"退款时限与原支付路径","id":"退款时限与原支付路径"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"14 天退款的两种起算锚点","id":"14-天退款的两种起算锚点"},{"level":3,"text":"「暂缓退款」的合法边界","id":"暂缓退款-的合法边界"},{"level":2,"text":"退款金额的构成","id":"退款金额的构成"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么必须逐项而非净额","id":"为什么必须逐项而非净额"},{"level":3,"text":"标准配送费的上限逻辑","id":"标准配送费的上限逻辑"},{"level":2,"text":"原支付路径：同路退回与它的例外","id":"原支付路径-同路退回与它的例外"},{"level":3,"text":"禁止转嫁退款手续费","id":"禁止转嫁退款手续费"},{"level":2,"text":"关税、税费与跨境资金","id":"关税-税费与跨境资金"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"退回运费归属与买家承担规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/statutory-withdrawal-coolingoff-compliance/withdrawal-execution/return-cost-buyer-assume-rule"},"next":{"title":"商品价值减损赔偿判定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/statutory-withdrawal-coolingoff-compliance/withdrawal-execution/value-diminution-compensation"}}